Date: Mon, 3 Aug 2026 12:38:24 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 162/168] =?UTF-8?q?fix(wenshu):=20R128b=20-=20cargo=20fall?=
 =?UTF-8?q?back=20path=20=E5=8A=A0=20.cargo/bin?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

[真根因 - PM-direct 排查]
- 装 user 跑 wenshu update --yes 12:34 - 卡在 'cargo was not found on PATH'
- update.py _resolve_executable('cargo') fallback paths 不含 ~/.cargo/bin
- 装 user cargo 实际位置: /Users/anbaiqiang/.cargo/bin/cargo (cargo 1.96.0)

[修法]
- _R128_FALLBACK_PATHS 加 '/Users/anbaiqiang/.cargo/bin' 第一个
- 装包器 DMG 重 build + 拷 Downloads (md5 待验)

[验证]
- python3 -m py_compile wenshu_cli/subcommands/update.py exit 0
- cargo tauri build exit 0

[装 user 必走]
- 跑新 DMG 装包器 ~/Downloads/WenShu-Setup.dmg
- 跑 wenshu update --yes
---
 wenshu_cli/subcommands/update.py | 3 ++-
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/hermes_cli/subcommands/update.py b/hermes_cli/subcommands/update.py
index 2682ce033..4c97a817c 100644
--- a/hermes_cli/subcommands/update.py
+++ b/hermes_cli/subcommands/update.py
@@ -15,10 +15,11 @@ from typing import Callable
 
 # R128: bootstrap-installed wenshu-cli runs from the installer's PATH context,
 # which often lacks the locations where `pnpm` and `cargo` actually live
-# (`~/.local/bin`, `/opt/homebrew/bin`, `~/.cargo/bin`). Without an explicit
+# (`~/.cargo/bin`, `/opt/homebrew/bin`, `~/.local/bin`). Without an explicit
 # probe the update flow falls back to RuntimeError("pnpm was not found on PATH")
 # even though the binaries are installed (e.g. ~/.local/share/pnpm/pnpm).
 _R128_FALLBACK_PATHS = (
+    "/Users/anbaiqiang/.cargo/bin",
     "/Users/anbaiqiang/.local/bin",
     "/Users/anbaiqiang/.local/share/pnpm",
     "/opt/homebrew/bin",
-- 
